  "body": "### Fixes\n- fix: CTX_REPLACE_TRIGGER_BYTES is no longer read; the replace trigger is the constant 4096 and doctor names a leftover value (ADR-0027 D1)\n- fix: remember a lost replace bet per session, ADR-0027 D3 (ADR-0027 D3)\n- fix: ctx_search reads a source in order when no query word is in it, so a replaced MCP document comes back in full pages (#1372)\n- fix: OMP doctor, setup and uninstall read OMP's plugin store and agent dir the way OMP does (#1415)\n- fix: codex setup list check reads codex mcp get context-mode --json and names a timeout (#1413)\n- fix: session-scoped unit recall and a lock-free prompt path (#1401)\n- fix: ctx_index and ctx_execute(file=) accept the folders the host added to the session (#1398)\n\n### Who gets this\n\nOne version on both channels: the release commit on main (GitHub) and npm.\n\n| Agent | Channel | Update with |\n|---|---|---|\n| Claude Code | GitHub | `claude plugin update context-mode@context-mode` |\n| Codex | GitHub, npm for the one-time hook trust step | `codex plugin marketplace upgrade context-mode` |\n| Gemini CLI | GitHub | `gemini extensions update context-mode` |\n| Qwen Code | GitHub | `qwen extensions update context-mode` |\n| Copilot CLI | npm | `context-mode upgrade` |\n| VS Code (Copilot) | npm | `context-mode upgrade` |\n| Kiro | npm | `context-mode upgrade` |\n| ZCode | GitHub | `zcode plugins update context-mode@context-mode` |\n| Pi | npm | `pi update --extensions` |\n| OpenCode | npm | `opencode plugin update` |\n| OMP | npm | `omp plugin upgrade context-mode` |",
